# Citation metadata for this software. Only cff-version, message, title and
# authors are required by the schema; the rest is recommended detail.
# `date-released` is intentionally omitted: no release has been cut yet.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "model-protocol-lab"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Stratos
    alias: strmt7
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/strmt7/model-protocol-lab"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A bounded experiment lab for local LLMs: render conversation-format
  hypotheses as exact token sequences, evaluate them against a local
  checkpoint with explicit boundary detection, and select at most one
  candidate under a conservative abstention rule with strict
  search/held-out separation.
keywords:
  - llm
  - evaluation
  - tokenizer
  - chat-template
  - experiment
